        },
        {
          "name": "Count Buffe Offset",
          "type": "UInt"
        },
        {
          "name": "Max Draw Arguments",
          "type": "UInt"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "Void",
      "docs": "Similar to RHIDrawIndexedPrimitiveIndirect, but allows many draw arguments to be provided at once.\nGRHIGlobals.SupportsDrawIndirect must be checked to detect support on the current machine.\n@ param IndexBuffer\t\t\tBuffer containing primitive indices\n@ param ArgumentsBuffer\t\tBuffer containing FRHIDrawIndexedIndirectParameters structures\n@ param ArgumentOffset\t\tOffset in bytes of the first element in ArgumentsBuffer that will be used for drawing\n@ param CountBuffer\t\t\tBuffer containing uint32 count of valid draw arguments that should be consumed (may be nullptr, indicating that only MaxDrawArguments value should be used)\n@ param CountBuffeOffset\t\tOffset in bytes for the CountBuffer element that will be used to source the draw argument count\n@ param MaxDrawArguments\t\tHow many draw arguments should be processed at most, i.e. NumDrawArguments = min(MaxDrawArguments, ValueFromCountBuffer)"
    },
